Lemma 9: f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, X), X)), f(f(Y, X), X)), f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, X), X)), f(f(Y, X), X)), f(f(X, f(f(Y, X), X)), f(f(Y, X), X)))) = f(f(X, f(f(Y, X), X)), f(f(Y, X), X)).
